				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ff4c4c">——</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#000000" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1039" y="934" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="16" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ff4c4c" width="58" height="22" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.30196078431372547">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ff4c4c">——</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#000000" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-历经百战的风役人%B7诡谲芒锋.assets/Image_14.png')" x="1166" y="847" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-历经百战的风役人%B7诡谲芒锋.assets/Image_15.png')" x="1006" y="847" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="67" y="62" fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="normal" color="#00ae83" width="207" height="28" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="造字工房悦圆 G0v1 常规体" fontSize="24" color="#00ae83">制图@Csxylic米游社</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="650" y="931" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="16" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffebbf" width="128" height="22" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.6">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffebbf">Shield Adv.</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#000000" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-历经百战的风役人%B7诡谲芒锋.assets/Image_16.png')" x="655" y="847" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-历经百战的风役人%B7诡谲芒锋.assets/Image_17.png')" x="814" y="846" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="806" y="931" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="16" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ff9999" width="139" height="41" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.6">
			<content>
				<p textAlign="center" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ff9999">Bond of Life Adv.</p>
			</content>
			<filters>
				<DropShadowFilter angle="40" color="#000000" distance="16" alpha="0.75" quality="2" blurX="25" blurY="25"/>
			</filters>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="1538" y="320" width="444" height="151" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="18" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">风役人瞄准目标，<span color="#ffebbf">消耗2%生命值</span><span>，2s后发动攻击，对目标敌人降下翠叶之诀，造成</span><span color="#7fffd7">90%</span><span>伤害并施加生命之契，随后发动追加「猎杀」攻击：<br/>翠叶之诀的场地将产生爆炸，造成</span><span color="#7fffd7">100%</span><span>伤害并施加生命之契。<br/>被施加生命之契的目标，在遭受每段追加「猎杀」时都会累积生命之契。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-历经百战的风役人%B7诡谲芒锋.assets/Image_18.png')" x="1519" y="233">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-历经百战的风役人%B7诡谲芒锋.assets/Image_19.png')" x="1396" y="267" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<BitmapImage source="@Embed('/星芒之役-历经百战的风役人%B7诡谲芒锋.assets/Image_20.png')" x="1376" y="246" blendMode="normal">
		</BitmapImage>
		<RichText x="66" y="704" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff" width="47" height="26" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">佞意：</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="67" y="896" fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontStyle="normal" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff" width="46" height="26" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">异浪：</p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="67" y="512" width="138" height="26" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="1">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="MiSans" fontSize="20" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffbfbf">(N5) <span color="#ffffff">诡绘白盾：</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="538" width="507" height="135" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">施放爆发时，役人自身会立即获得白盾，厚度为<span color="#ffbfbf">22.5%生命值</span><span>，期间抗打断为0.01；击破白盾后役人将</span><span color="#ffdfbf">失去等量生命值</span><span>。<br/>白盾存在期间，役人将</span><span color="#ffbfbf">持续</span><span>向全队角色</span><span color="#ffbfbf">施加生命之契</span><span>，先施加</span><span color="#ffbfbf">500%</span><span>攻击力的生命之契，之后每0.5s施加</span><span color="#ffbfbf">75%</span><span>攻击力的生契。<br/>对于</span><span color="#ffbfbf">N5</span><span>和</span><span color="#ffacff">N6</span><span>难度，役人首次施加</span><span color="#ffdfbf">27100</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">29028</span><span>点生命之契，后续每0.5秒施加</span><span color="#ffdfbf">4065</span><span>/</span><span color="#ffdfbf">4354</span><span>点生命之契。<br/>角色离地时依旧能够展开白盾。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="736" width="497" height="116" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">役人的爆发的每段伤害都会施加<span color="#ffbfbf">16%</span><span>攻击力的生命之契，且在该生命之契的影响下，被命中的角色将每秒流失</span><span color="#ffdfbf">(0.4%HP+72)</span><span>的生命值(后台止于5%)，持续10min，或清除生命之契后解除。<br/>施放爆发时，</span><span color="#ffdfbf">消耗2%生命值</span><span>；爆发的第一段伤害命中时，</span><span color="#ffebbf">恢复5%生命值</span><span>；当生命值</span><span color="#ffebbf">低于20%</span><span>时，施放爆发改为</span><span color="#ffebbf">消耗10%当前生命值</span><span>。<br/>爆发的追加攻击对附有生命之契的目标造成的伤害提升</span><span color="#ffbfbf">150%</span><span>。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="66" y="928" width="496" height="39" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="16" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">役人离地、卡死，或受到击退、击飞等技能效果的影响，会<span color="#ffdfbf">立即闪现脱离</span><span>，并进行展开护盾等行为。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
	</Group>
	<Group d:userLabel="层_2" d:type="layer">
	</Group>
</Graphic>